# Pokémon artwork and maps (Nintendo / The Pokémon Company IP): never in the
# repository or a release. The app fetches each picture from PokeAPI's public
# sprites on first use and keeps it on the user's PC (server/sprites.js).
public/sprites/pokemon/
public/rooms/pokemon-*.png
tools/_cache/

# Poké Ball artwork (Bulbagarden Archives, Nintendo IP): fetched at build time by
# tools/fetch-balls.mjs, shipped inside the app, never committed
public/sprites/balls/

# The screenshot harness's own server home (tests/visual/shots.mjs)
tests/visual/.home/
